"┌session-202┌ Help ────────────────────────────────────────────────┐───────────┐"
"│           │  Key          Action                                 │           │"
"│           │                                                      │           │"
"│           │  Enter        submit prompt / execute command        │           │"
"│           │  Esc          cancel stream / close overlay          │           │"
"│           │  Ctrl+T       toggle running input target            │           │"
"│           │  Up/Down      recall prompt history                  │           │"
"│           │  PgUp/PgDn    jump 10; Ctrl+Alt+U/D                  │           │"
"│           │  Ctrl+Alt+Y/E scroll by 1 line                       │           │"
"│           │  Mouse        select text; --mouse enables wheel     │           │"
"│           │  Ctrl+C       quit immediately                       │           │"
"│           │  Ctrl+D x2    quit (double-press within 3s)          │           │"
"│           │                                                      │           │"
